{"overview":"روتِه روزن (Rote Rosen) یک تلنوواِل آلمانی است که توسط استودیوی هامبورگ سری‌ن‌ورفت لونی‌بورگ تولید و از ۶ نوامبر ۲۰۰۶ توسط شبکه داس ارسته پخش می‌شود. این سریال یک تلنوواِل پیچیده است که در هر فصل یک داستان عاشقانه درباره زنان در چهل‌سالگی روایت می‌کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Rote Rosen is a German telenovela produced by Studio Hamburg Serienwerft Lüneburg and broadcast by Das Erste since November 6, 2006. The show is a complex telenovela, who tells one love story every season about women in their forties.","tagline_en":"","runtime":50,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":100,"y":2006,"poster":"/gmDdU1WUNotrsD7gwbbOR06FoqM.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":100,"y":2007,"poster":"/9Dxuv7Sf1nxPBibTxpYiko5m4vi.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":200,"y":2007,"poster":"/9nx8oOEsZHnggGCnEuEyI29QLgg.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":200,"y":2008,"poster":"/iGTAewR7CZiZ3r75k7MHRLaoCTr.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":200,"y":2009,"poster":"/cPMdg1MEVMSUdv2zmjQslnZsfnX.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":200,"y":2010,"poster":"/b52Bup2zelZtjVoSGEDEBD5kX20.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":200,"y":2011,"poster":"/hFo9QMpLJ5BN25PXvE3iAPmI8Wg.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":200,"y":2012,"poster":"/pkGw8g1MYnKuTIpdV2uQSgvD49R.jpg"},{"n":9,"name":"فصل 9","ep":200,"y":2012,"poster":"/iK4dxFua65cwTZ9xeZGXNwJTxGx.jpg"},{"n":10,"name":"فصل 10","ep":200,"y":2013,"poster":"/qwobTmwj29BuE7kDJHTNMtcka9S.jpg"},{"n":11,"name":"فصل 11","ep":200,"y":2014,"poster":"/6eQhqjmk3CKYscbmGoEhXM75MyM.jpg"},{"n":12,"name":"فصل 12","ep":200,"y":2015,"poster":"/4B1KWsit9Nj8lu7PeREqxa8oKEY.jpg"},{"n":13,"name":"فصل 13","ep":200,"y":2016,"poster":"/vq63NfCmaYC7QlAouEODCuDdcYA.jpg"},{"n":14,"name":"فصل 14","ep":200,"y":2017,"poster":"/eXXJ4trau6YnrvOtlWb3MCSiOwp.jpg"},{"n":15,"name":"فصل 15","ep":200,"y":2018,"poster":"/cu7VnUxuBvEVrf3G0jSHslOyT1m.jpg"},{"n":16,"name":"فصل 16","ep":200,"y":2019,"poster":"/bHh0HIaNJxMeIt8mO3tsYAwLzEz.jpg"},{"n":17,"name":"فصل 17","ep